bianbu-agent-runtime (0.1.153) resolute-porting; urgency=medium

  * Let the console attach any file or a whole directory, and warn instead of
    blocking when the model cannot read images. Attachments were image-only,
    and a model without vision was refused at upload time and again on prompt.
    The composer now offers an upload-file and an upload-folder entry, a single
    file keeps the magic-byte check so its stored suffix matches the bytes,
    every other file is typed by extension into video/file, and a directory is
    stored under one uuid root and reported with its file count. The prompt
