    images, read_file or search_files for files, search_files or terminal for
    a directory. Availability is now a warning, not a gate: GET
    /sessions/{id}/vision still answers whether some configured model can read
    an image and the console shows it next to the input, but the upload and
    prompt routes accept the bytes either way. Uploads are limited to 10 MiB
    per image, 64 MiB per file and 2000 files / 256 MiB per directory, with
    relative paths resolved under the stored root.

