    input modalities of its model. Availability is now decided from an
    explicit `capability-vision` model record first and the model name family
    second, both before the user picks a file and again on upload, so a model
    that cannot read images answers with the product sentence instead of
    failing later. An uploaded image is stored in the Agent workspace and
    announced by path, and the new `read_image` tool reads it with a vision
    model. Uploads are limited to 10 MiB and to png/jpeg/webp/gif by magic
    bytes rather than by the client's content type.
