    icon, stable run identity) as 0.1.129. 0.1.128 never reached the archive:
    the binary .changes generated by the packaging job lost one byte of a
    multi-byte character inside the changelog text, so `bianbu-dev upload`
    failed with `UnicodeDecodeError: invalid continuation byte` at byte 650
    of the 1343-byte file. Release commit subjects and the tag comment stay
