bianbu-agent-runtime (0.1.63) resolute-porting; urgency=medium

  * Hand every Bibit Intent edge failure to the Runtime model instead of
    answering the user that the edge result is unconfirmed. A failed edge
    request now reports route=cloud with reason=edge_error and
