bianbu-agent-runtime (0.1.54) resolute-porting; urgency=medium

  * Retire standalone Hook packages: Hooks are Plugin members only.  The
    `hooks/` data root, `hook_dirs` configuration, Hook package lifecycle
    commands and the Hook package API kind are gone.  A Plugin contributes its
