bianbu-agent-runtime (0.1.39) resolute-porting; urgency=medium

  * Read installed Plugins through one tolerant entry point.  A directory that
    is not a valid Plugin no longer fails the whole catalog: `plugin list`, the
    Inventory scan and the Worker generation skip it with a warning, so system
    Plugins stay visible.  Redirectable entries (symbolic links, escaping paths,
    reserved ownership metadata) still fail the read instead of being skipped.
