    single lowercase token (`superpowers`) as well as namespaced ones.
  * Discover hand-placed Skill directories.  A `skills/<name>/SKILL.md` dropped
    into the data directory is listed, shown, verified and removed from its own
    content, without writing SDK ownership metadata into it.
